10:50:06  == Your files
10:50:06  Chat Computer can't open macOS's own files: on this Mac they're always encrypted, with keys only macOS can use
10:50:06  (FileVault or not). So setup copies the folders you choose onto a drive called ChatComp that both systems open;
10:50:07  macOS keeps its own copies. What you save on that drive in Chat Computer is in macOS too, and you can send more
10:50:07  later (run setup again).
10:50:07  macOS may ask whether Terminal can open your Desktop, Documents and Downloads folders: choose OK.
